<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <title>Game Night</title>
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(#FFFFFF, #cfe2f3);
        }

        .navbar {
            background-color: #cfe2f3;
            padding: 12px 20px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            background: linear-gradient(#B0D0ED, #cfe2f3);
        }

        .navbar-left {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
        }
      
        .navbar-right {
            display: flex;
            gap: 10px;
        }

        .logo-box {
            border: 2px solid #1a5276;
            padding: 6px 14px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #1a5276;
            font-size: 14px;
            /* Replace the text below with an <img> tag once a logo is available */
        }

        .site-name {
            color: #1a5276;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 16px;
        }

        .navbar a {
            color: black;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .navbar a:hover {
            text-decoration: underline;
        }

        .main {
            padding: 30px 40px;
        }

        h1 {
            text-align: center;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 3em;
            color: black;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        h3 {
            text-align: center;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 1em;
            color: black;
            margin-top: 10px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .section-title {
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 1.5em;
            text-align: center;
            color: black;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        .content-box {
            border: 1px solid #1a5276;
            border-radius: 15px;
            background-color: white;
            min-height: 100px;
            width: 100%;
            padding: 10px;
            font-size: 20px;
            color: #333;
            text-align: center;
        }
      
        .columns {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            gap: 20px;
        }

        .column {
            flex: 1;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 10px;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <div class="navbar">
        <div class="navbar-left">
            <div class="logo-box">Logo</div>
            <span class="site-name">Quinstance</span>
        </div>
        <div class="navbar-right">
            <a href="/home">Home</a>
        </div>
    </div>

    <main class="main">
        <h1>How to Play!</h1>
      
        <div class="columns">
            <div class="column">
                <div class="content-box">
                    <h2 class="section-title">Quizzes</h2>
                    <h3>Create a Quiz</h3>
                    <p>Create quizzes with questions that have up to 4 possible answers - but only one correct option!.
                    Quizzes have an assigned Category and Key Stage, with a wide range of options to choose from.</p>
                    <h3>Edit Quizzes</h3>
                    <p>Edit anything you customised! Thought of a new name for your Quiz? Think a question is too easy
                    or way too difficult? Edit that too - no need to recreate a quiz or question!</p>
                    <h3>Delete a Quiz</h3>
                    <p>Not happy with your quiz? Not to worry! You can just delete it and try again.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="column">
                <h2 class="section-title">Minigames:</h2>
                <p>Text</p>
            </div>

            <div class="column">
                <h2 class="section-title">Being a Ghost:</h2>
                <p>Text</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </main>

</body>
</html>
